EFO-Plutchik ontology package
==============================

This repository contains two kinds of artifacts under two licenses.

1. Ontology, SHACL shapes, SPARQL queries and documentation
   (ontology/*.ttl, ontology/*.rq, releases/**, docs/**, README.md)
   Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
   Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode)
   This matches `dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>`
   declared inside ontology/efo-plutchik.ttl.

2. Validation / build code (src/**, scripts/**, ontology/*.py, tests/**)
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Full text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
   (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

Third-party files: the Emotion Frame Ontology (EFO) by De Giorgis &
Gangemi (https://github.com/StenDoipanni/EFO) is NOT distributed with this
repository. The upstream repository declares no license (checked
2026-11-15), so permission to redistribute is not granted. For the EFO
alignment check, src/provenance/validate.py downloads EmoCore_iswc.ttl and
BE_iswc.ttl from a pinned upstream commit into ontology/efo-src/ (ignored by
git) and verifies their SHA-256. These files are not covered by either
license above.

Attribution: Kota Fuse.
